source_wording_tex:
\label{def:six-part}
Each E-law is presented in the following order: Setup; Theorem; Proof spine;
Case enumeration; Interaction status; Nonclaims.  The layer-instantiation
paragraph that follows is not a seventh proof field.  It identifies candidate
realizations and the bridge data each must provide.

