source_wording_tex:
\label{lem:diag_L2_bound}
For every cell \(B\) of size \(b\),
\[
\sum_{i\in B} p_i
\;\le\;
b\mu + \sqrt{b}\,\|p-\mu\|_2.
\]
Consequently,
\begin{equation}\label{eq:trace_bound_L2}
\mathrm{trace\_bound}_j(U)
\;\le\;
\frac{m}{2^j}
\;+\;
\sqrt{\frac{N}{2^j}}\;\Bigl\|\mathrm{diag}(P) - \frac{m}{N}\mathbf{1}\Bigr\|_2.
\end{equation}

