\item[\RungStrictPartition{}.] The strict-test partition rung is the inherited rung that fixes the accepted new-layer strict-test substrate: accepted strict test families, native strict slots, and slot realizations.  It supplies input for later rungs but does not itself construct event-level records.  It is the strict-test-only base on which the paper-10-new event-level attempt is mounted.  See \Cref{subsec:strict-test-partition-rung}.

